# --- Base-data sources (sensitive — never commit) ---
# Reckoner, MF Monitor, Analytics workbooks live only on the admin's machine
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.xlsb
*.csv
*.ppt
*.pptm
*.doc
*.rar
*.msg
*.eml
.env
.env.*
uploads/
inputs/

# --- Local-only workspace folders (sensitive or bulky; only their README files are tracked) ---
# monthly-updates/  the owner drops each month's source files into 00_INBOX/; processed months are archived beside it
# backups/          snapshots of the six deploy files taken before every refresh
# handover-archive/ the zips and PRD exactly as received from the outgoing owner
monthly-updates/*
!monthly-updates/README.md
!monthly-updates/00_INBOX/
monthly-updates/00_INBOX/*
!monthly-updates/00_INBOX/README.md
backups/*
!backups/README.md
handover-archive/*
!handover-archive/README.md
*.zip
*.7z

# --- Dashboard backups / broken states from local builds ---
# NOTE: "*.bak" matches only names ENDING in .bak, so the dated snapshots
# (index.html.bak_directeq_20260728, *.bak2 …) need their own patterns.
# Without these a plain `git add .` pushes ~250 MB of backups.
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.bak[0-9]
*.bak[0-9]*
*.broken
*.broken*
*.tmp

# --- Local tooling / scratch ---
# .claude/ is local except the shared project config: agents, skills (slash commands),
# the preview server and its launch config. settings.local.json stays private.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/serve.js
!.claude/launch.json
node_modules/
_testdata/

# --- Misc generated artefacts ---
*.docx
*.pptx
*.pdf

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Local-only working files Claude wrote into the workspace ---
Centricity_Investment_Proposal.pptx
Centricity_Playbook_Handoff.docx
Dashboard_Build_Prompt.md
